{"articleNo":"470760","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=470760&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] KIT 홍보 동영상 공모전 안내(기간연장)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.12.11","hit":"13131","attachments":[{"name":"붙임1_KIT 홍보영상 공모전 안내(23.12.11.)연장.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=470760&attachNo=129699"},{"name":"붙임2_KIT 홍보영상 공모전 참가 서식(23.12.11).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=470760&attachNo=129700"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">[2023</span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">KIT </span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;\">홍보 동영상 공모전 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">]<span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Noto; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">기간연장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">금오공대를 소재로 대학의 교육 자산 등에 대한 개방과 공유 확대로 지역 사회와 상생 협력을</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">강화하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">창의적인 콘텐츠를 발굴하기 위하여 다음과 같이 공모전을 실시하오니 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">공모대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">금오공대를 사랑하는 국민</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">공모주제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">금오공대의 멋과 매력을 뽑낼 수 있는 자유주제</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3 .</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">참가방식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">개인 또는 팀 단위</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(4</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">명 이내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">시상내역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">최우수상 등 총 시상금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">300</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">만원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:60.8pt;text-indent:-60.8pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">참가학생은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">BISKIT</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">마일리지 부여</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">공모일정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2023. 11. 20.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) ~ 2024. 1. 12.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">발표 및 시상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2024. 1. 26.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">상세내역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: [</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">]</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">참조</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmGYHoEZkhJAzgSwCIDMDGAnA8gGwA0AtAUQCEAvAGQFkBzAYQAlUA6AKwAd6g%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"11427\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"User\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2023-12-11T14:08:10.581Z\",\n\"md\": \"2023-12-11T14:08:10.606Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\": false,\n\"tq\": false,\n\"da\": false,\n\"dw\": false,\n\"dj\": false,\n\"bc\": false,\n\"bu\": false,\n\"al\": false,\n\"ab\": false,\n\"ap\": false,\n\"an\": false,\n\"aa\": false,\n\"ds\": false,\n\"de\": false,\n\"as\": false,\n\"cp\": false,\n\"ao\"